Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:51:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Deck layer: DeckLink shares the USB port between protocol
 4 and the console

NOT FOR UPSTREAM (ESP32 PC Control Deck only).

DeckLink reads the USB serial port: COBS frames (first byte 0x02) go
to the Deck (ping is answered with hello, console_input runs a console
line through runConsoleLine and returns console_output, other frames are
queued for the Deck app); plain text lines go to the serial console as
before. Replaces consoleReadLine() in main.cpp and consolePoll().


